#2650
The Crossing Of The Orders~
   The stair ends in a crossing where the halls of the three orders of the
college meet, and their powers push and pull against one another in the air.
A grey-tiled hall leads south to the Grey Order, a black-tiled hall east to
the Black, and a white-tiled hall west to the White. To the north a wide
